return Scaffold(

Scaffold provides the basic page structure.

It can contain:

AppBar
Body
Drawer
Floating Action Button
Bottom Navigation Bar
Step 12: AppBar
appBar: AppBar(

Creates the top application bar.

title: const Text("Responsive UI"),

Displays:

Responsive UI
centerTitle: true,

Centers the title in the AppBar.

Step 13: Ternary Operator
body: screenWidth < 600
    ? buildMobileLayout()
    : buildTabletLayout(),

This uses Dart's ternary operator.

General syntax:

condition ? valueIfTrue : valueIfFalse;

In this program:

screenWidth < 600

If true:

buildMobileLayout()

If false:

buildTabletLayout()

Equivalent if-else code:

if (screenWidth < 600) {
    body = buildMobileLayout();
} else {
    body = buildTabletLayout();
}
