Creates 3 columns.

Layout:

Home      Profile     Settings

Favorites Notifications Cart
Column Spacing
crossAxisSpacing: 20,

Adds 20 pixels between columns.

Row Spacing
mainAxisSpacing: 20,

Adds 20 pixels between rows.

